# Health V3 is the canonical customer-health system — its lineage and run
# history must be recoverable. The 2026-09 audit found the entire V3.3.x doc
# layer and trigger_engine_v1.py had been lost precisely because they were
# never committed. Track this folder's archive and runs.
!Health V3/_archive/
!Health V3/_archive/**
!Health V3/runs/**/_archive/
!Health V3/runs/**/_archive/**
